Scoped reference metadata and WAV RIFF fields

The reference-profile branch in src/wav-mux.ts follows the fixed FFmpeg
libavformat/riffenc.c ff_put_wav_header layout predicate and channel-mask fields,
and libavformat/wavenc.c fact-sample trailer semantics. The empty non-PCM fact
value preserves the fixed reference's timestamp-sentinel result. This scope is
not a port of the complete WAV/RF64/peak-envelope muxer.

